 usage rights. We ask for 30 percent of the climbing rights—for every ten climbs, our Trekkers take three.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_110","You're putting up 20 billion, but you don't want usage rights or even half the climbs. Only 30 percent.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Lady Mercurio, those terms are too generous.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","Naturally, there are strings attached.==W== Omnisky Aegis would like to propose a wager.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","004","idea",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_052"],["stg",0,-150.0,null,1.3,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg3_220","a","003",null,0.55,-0.27,1.3,null,"JuGong","OutQuad",0.8],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.25,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.8],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_220","a","004","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","If you two still work for United Harvest Philae at the next Monolith bid in ten years, Omnisky Aegis won't contest the rights—we'll help you win.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_220","But if you no longer work for United Harvest Philae by then, we expect the company to withdraw and do everything possible to help us win.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","002",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.7],["ctl","avg3_220","a","012",null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.7],["stg",0,200.0,null,1.3,"OutSine",0.7,null,null,null],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_110","c","008","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","A wager on where we'll be in ten years... Fair enough.==W== But why stake this on Boss and me?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009","attention",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","007","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","Omnisky Aegis considers you two far more valuable—and better allies—than the company itself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","013","shock",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.28,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["ctl","avg3_220","a",null,null,0.53,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.8],["stg",0,-100.0,null,null,"Linear",0.8,null,null,null],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_220","a","004","star",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","We're offering these terms purely because you're at the helm. We're happy to spend extra Dorra to clear the air.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","If you stay in charge, we stand as your allies. But if you step away, we expect your help in taking over Philae ourselves.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_055"],["w",0.3],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Then it looks like we're allies. Firenze and I will never consider abandoning this company.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a",null,"music",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","That works for us. Omnisky Aegis lacks grand ambitions. We only want reliable partners in this chaotic world of Nova.",0,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg3_220","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutSine",1.0,null,null,null],["bg","mood_3",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Her terms sound sincere, but I can't tell how true they are. I'll need to read every clause of that magic contract carefully.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["hide","avg1_110"],["ctl","avg3_220","a","002",null,0.7,-0.08,1.1,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_110","c","002",0.28,-0.08,1.1,0,null,0.0],["bg","hotpot_inside",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_220","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.7],["w",1],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Mercurio, we need to discuss this privately. Barring any surprises, we'll accept the wager.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","007","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_220","Heh. Then, to our working together. Cheers.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Hold on. Now that business is settled, we have a personal question. Can you tell us about your new life insurance policies?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","008","symbol",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","Oh? You're looking for insurance? Welcome. We offer several types: medical, life, and comprehensive. Which one interests you?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","017",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Life insurance.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","005","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","Life insurance? Hmm. People ask about it, but no one ever follows through.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","After all, the policy is simple: if the insured passes away under the contract's terms, the beneficiary gets a payout.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","Most people see it as betting your own life against Omnisky Aegis for a payout.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","012",null