st agony isn't physical. It's knowing they leave us with nothing.",3,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_220","They beg us to stop wasting Dorra on them.",3,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_125"],["ctl","avg3_220","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg3_220","But how do we pull the plug? We lose them anyway, and go bankrupt.",3,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_220","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["film",1],["w",1.3],["say","avg3_220","Someday I'll be a mother. I push this policy so I never experience that regret again.",0,""],["w",1.0],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","mood_4",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I have no idea there's such heartbreak behind this.==W== It says death insurance, but it's a beautiful way to protect people.",1,""],["w",0.3],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_110","c","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["bg","hotpot_inside",0,1.0],["w",1.3],["se","se_075"],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,-0.13,1.12,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.25,"InQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.3],["ctl","avg1_110","c","003","music",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Understood. Put us down for a thousand policies each.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"xiaozhen"],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","007","symbol",null],["say","avg3_100","A-A thousand?!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","city_street_water",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["bgm","m44"],["head","21:00, Venatio Month 13th, Silver District in Philae, Unnamed Street"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","005","question",null],["sa